   "text": "1.x — SwissKitJ toolbox beginnings\nSwing desktop app (IntelliJ UI Designer)\nExcel processing / bulk email / Happy-learning plugin\nEmbedded H2 database · first commit 2026-02-25\n8 prereleases → v1.0.0 stable (03-29)\nv1.1 / v1.2.x rapid bugfix iteration",
   "originalText": "1.x — SwissKitJ toolbox beginnings\nSwing desktop app (IntelliJ UI Designer)\nExcel processing / bulk email / Happy-learning plugin\nEmbedded H2 database · first commit 2026-02-25\n8 prereleases → v1.0.0 stable (03-29)\nv1.1 / v1.2.x rapid bugfix iteration",
