   "rawText": "2.x — Pluginization & engineering\nMaven multi-module + SwissKitJ-Api BOM governance\nAnnotation-based plugin discovery (KitPage removed)\nCentralized release pipeline rework\nv2.0.2 official-plugin i18n\nv2.1.x language persistence / drag-reorder menus"
