   "updated": 1756000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "3.x — JavaFX migration + AI subsystem\nv3.0.0 (06-12): JavaFX Migration · plugin store redesign ·\n  slash commands · plugin class isolation (child-first ClassLoader)\nv3.0.1 (06-21): FunctionGemma offline multi-turn tool calls ·\n  Chinese keyword normalization (OfflineNlNormalizer)\nv3.1.0 (06-25): LangChain4j ChatBackend unifying OpenAI/Anthropic ·\n  plugin-declared AI tools · Qwen3-4B local inference (out-of-process worker)\nv3.2.0 (07-07): IDEA 2025 New UI redesign → merged to main",
   "originalText": "3.x — JavaFX migration + AI subsystem\nv3.0.0 (06-12): JavaFX Migration · plugin store redesign ·\n  slash commands · plugin class isolation (child-first ClassLoader)\nv3.0.1 (06-21): FunctionGemma offline multi-turn tool calls ·\n  Chinese keyword normalization (OfflineNlNormalizer)\nv3.1.0 (06-25): LangChain4j ChatBackend unifying OpenAI/Anthropic ·\n  plugin-declared AI tools · Qwen3-4B local inference (out-of-process worker)\nv3.2.0 (07-07): IDEA 2025 New UI redesign → merged to main",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": "rec-071-8490",
   "lineHeight": 1.4,
   "autoResize": true,
   "rawText": "3.x — JavaFX migration + AI subsystem\nv3.0.0 (06-12): JavaFX Migration · plugin store redesign ·\n  slash commands · plugin class isolation (child-first ClassLoader)\nv3.0.1 (06-21): FunctionGemma offline multi-turn tool calls ·\n  Chinese keyword normalization (OfflineNlNormalizer)\nv3.1.0 (06-25): LangChain4j ChatBackend unifying OpenAI/Anthropic ·\n  plugin-declared AI tools · Qwen3-4B local inference (out-of-process worker)\nv3.2.0 (07-07): IDEA 2025 New UI redesign → merged to main"
  },
