   "versionNonce": 59813742,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1756000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "4.0.0 — Infinia headless rewrite\nHeadless Spring Boot backend (loopback only, 127.0.0.1:24056)\nVue 3.5 + TypeScript SPA (browser / desktop isomorphic)\nElectron 43 desktop shell (migrated from Tauri at alpha.3)\n.fyp sandboxed plugins = iframe UI + out-of-process JSON-RPC worker\nalpha (07-19~): public launch · Setup wizard · lite/JRE variants\nbeta (08-09~): plugin market · Flow canvas (IF/LLM nodes) ·\n  code-first plugin contract · desktop auto-update · UOS support\nCurrent branch 4.0.0-folw: Flow-focused work",
   "originalText": "4.0.0 — Infinia headless rewrite\nHeadless Spring Boot backend (loopback only, 127.0.0.1:24056)\nVue 3.5 + TypeScript SPA (browser / desktop isomorphic)\nElectron 43 desktop shell (migrated from Tauri at alpha.3)\n.fyp sandboxed plugins = iframe UI + out-of-process JSON-RPC worker\nalpha (07-19~): public launch · Setup wizard · lite/JRE variants\nbeta (08-09~): plugin market · Flow canvas (IF/LLM nodes) ·\n  code-first plugin contract · desktop auto-update · UOS support\nCurrent branch 4.0.0-folw: Flow-focused work",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": "rec-073-5506",
   "lineHeight": 1.4,
   "autoResize": true,
   "rawText": "4.0.0 — Infinia headless rewrite\nHeadless Spring Boot backend (loopback only, 127.0.0.1:24056)\nVue 3.5 + TypeScript SPA (browser / desktop isomorphic)\nElectron 43 desktop shell (migrated from Tauri at alpha.3)\n.fyp sandboxed plugins = iframe UI + out-of-process JSON-RPC worker\nalpha (07-19~): public launch · Setup wizard · lite/JRE variants\nbeta (08-09~): plugin market · Flow canvas (IF/LLM nodes) ·\n  code-first plugin contract · desktop auto-update · UOS support\nCurrent branch 4.0.0-folw: Flow-focused work"
  },
  {
