   "text": "Version lines: the app version (Maven ${revision}) and the plugin toolchain version (toolchain/sdk-java, @infinia/*) evolve independently and are never synchronized.",
   "originalText": "Version lines: the app version (Maven ${revision}) and the plugin toolchain version (toolchain/sdk-java, @infinia/*) evolve independently and are never synchronized.",
