   "text": "0.x — SwissKit (predecessor, separate repo)\ngithub.com/MuskStark/SwissKit · Python + Flet\nExcel splitting (format/style kept · output folder)\nBulk email (group tags · attachments · SSL/TLS)\npeewee/SQLite database · Windows installer\nv0.2.1 (07-21) → v0.3.3 (11-13) · 12 tags\nFrom 2026 evolved into this repo's 1.x (Java/Swing)",
